        "html": "\n<div class=\"wo002-play-page\">\n  <section class=\"wo002-play-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"play-title\">\n    <div class=\"wo002-play-hero__copy\"><p class=\"section-kicker\">TOADAL FEAST · BROWSER GAMES</p><h1 id=\"play-title\">Play a little Feast.</h1>\n      <p>Explore four browser-game listings. One staging build opens in the website player; the CLAW candidate is held for origin-safety work, and two concepts have no playable website package.</p>\n      <a class=\"button-link button-link--primary\" href=\"#browser-games\">Browse the games <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a>\n    </div>\n    <aside class=\"wo002-play-proof\" aria-label=\"Play availability summary\"><span class=\"chip preview\">PREVIEW ONLY</span><strong>1</strong><p>staging build open in player</p><small>CLAW is held pending origin-safe integration. No account or cross-device save is offered.</small></aside>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"wo002-game-library\" aria-labelledby=\"game-library-title\">\n    <header class=\"wo002-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">CHOOSE YOUR NEXT ADVENTURE</p><h2 id=\"game-library-title\">Browser games</h2></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/\">Back to Home <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></header>\n    <div class=\"game-tabs\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filter browser games\">\n      <button class=\"game-tab\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-game-tab=\"all\">All games <span>4</span></button>\n      <button class=\"game-tab\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-game-tab=\"preview\">Preview <span>4</span></button>\n      <button class=\"game-tab\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-game-tab=\"public\">Public <span>0</span></button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"game-empty\" data-game-empty hidden role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">No games are listed in this state yet.</p>\n    <div id=\"browser-games\" class=\"play-card-grid\">\n  <article class=\"module studio-game-card play-card\" data-game-id=\"wicked-bites\" data-game-status=\"preview\">\n    <a class=\"play-card__art\" href=\"/games/wicked-bites/\" aria-label=\"View Wicked Bites game details\">\n      <img src=\"/assets/images/world/candy-kingdom.webp\" alt=\"Candy Kingdom world artwork, not an in-game screenshot.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"chip preview\">PREVIEW</span>\n    </a>\n    <div class=\"play-card__body\"><p class=\"play-card__eyebrow\">STAGING BUILD · 5.5</p>\n      <h3>Wicked Bites</h3><p>A compact, isolated browser preview from the Wicked Bites 5.5 staging build. The listing remains PREVIEW and is not a public release.</p>\n      <a class=\"button-link button-link--secondary\" href=\"/games/wicked-bites/\">View game details <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"module studio-game-card play-card\" data-game-id=\"claw-feed-gulper\" data-game-status=\"preview\">\n    <a class=\"play-card__art\" href=\"/games/claw-feed-gulper/\" aria-label=\"View CLAW: Feed Gulper game details\">\n      <img src=\"/assets/images/characters/gulper.webp\" alt=\"Gulper character artwork, not an in-game screenshot.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"chip preview\">PREVIEW</span>\n    </a>\n    <div class=\"play-card__body\"><p class=\"play-card__eyebrow\">STAGING CANDIDATE · LAUNCH HELD · 2.5.1</p>\n      <h3>CLAW: Feed Gulper</h3><p>A versioned staging package exists, but website launch is held: its save namespace and original broad service-worker cache behavior require origin-safe requalification.</p>\n      <a class=\"button-link button-link--secondary\" href=\"/games/claw-feed-gulper/\">View game details <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"module studio-game-card play-card\" data-game-id=\"toadal-tower-defense\" data-game-status=\"preview\">\n    <a class=\"play-card__art\" href=\"/games/toadal-tower-defense/\" aria-label=\"View TOADAL Tower Defense game details\">\n      <img src=\"/assets/images/world/candy-kingdom.webp\" alt=\"Candy Kingdom world artwork, not game footage.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"chip preview\">PREVIEW</span>\n    </a>\n    <div class=\"play-card__body\"><p class=\"play-card__eyebrow\">CONCEPT PREVIEW</p>\n      <h3>TOADAL Tower Defense</h3><p>A preview concept only. No runnable browser package is connected, and the shared world artwork is not gameplay footage.</p>\n      <a class=\"button-link button-link--secondary\" href=\"/games/toadal-tower-defense/\">View game details <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"module studio-game-card play-card\" data-game-id=\"froggy-fruity-bash\" data-game-status=\"preview\">\n    <a class=\"play-card__art\" href=\"/games/froggy-fruity-bash/\" aria-label=\"View Froggy Fruity Bash game details\">\n      <img src=\"/assets/images/characters/genie-fruity.webp\" alt=\"Fruity Genie character artwork, not game footage.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"chip preview\">PREVIEW</span>\n    </a>\n    <div class=\"play-card__body\"><p class=\"play-card__eyebrow\">CONCEPT PREVIEW</p>\n      <h3>Froggy Fruity Bash</h3><p>A preview concept only. No runnable browser package is connected, and the character artwork is not gameplay footage.</p>\n      <a class=\"button-link button-link--secondary\" href=\"/games/froggy-fruity-bash/\">View game details <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a>\n    </div>\n  </article></div>\n  </section>\n  <aside class=\"wo002-truth-note\"><strong>About these previews</strong><p>PREVIEW means a build is available for evaluation, not that it is a public release. Each detail page identifies whether a runnable website package is connected.</p></aside>\n</div>"
